# ToyVerse Tab — app serving + kiosk
#
# The ToyVerse apps are self-contained HTML. We serve them from localhost and
# show them in a lightweight WebKit browser. Two modes — choose in BUILD.md:
#
#   APPLIANCE / KIOSK : boots straight into the launcher, locked to the apps.
#   WORKSTATION       : normal Sxmo desktop; launcher is one tap away, and the
#                       security-research tools are usable in a terminal.
#
# The default install sets up WORKSTATION and ALSO installs the kiosk service
# disabled, so you can switch with one command (see scripts/install-overlay.sh).

cog                 # WPE-WebKit browser, single-page kiosk friendly
cage                # Wayland kiosk compositor (fullscreen single app) — optional
busybox-extras      # busybox httpd static server for /srv/toyverse

# If you want a fuller browser for the workstation mode (heavier on 1 GB RAM):
# firefox-esr       # usable but slow here; prefer cog for the dashboards
# netsurf           # very light, but weak modern-CSS/JS support — apps may break
